ideo/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE YOUR POWER AS THE VAMPIRE LORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon loyal companions to fight by your side and unleash chaos upon your enemies. As your reputation grows, so does your influence — calling forth stronger, deadlier allies bound to your dark will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/72eca5dd3208aebaea6359b8e0bfea57.poster.avif?t=1787062441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/extras/72eca5dd3208aebaea6359b8e0bfea57.webm?t=1787062441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASH WITH COLOSSAL BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for unforgettable battles against towering monstrosities.</p>", "short_description": "Claim your throne as Vampire Lord in this survivors-like. Each run is another step on your journey with new followers, quests and skills to unlock. The night is yours to conquer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Italian, Spanish - Latin America, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The devs are just nailing it with these terribly twisted boss monsters.”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“Another horde survivor that exceeds my expectations.”<br>Only Roguelikes<br><br>“The most addicting game of 2025!”<br>OHRye<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668370/ca814294321af4a7eb478d93ed035179190dbb96/header.jpg?t=1787062441", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto